// ## 7. Arithmetic Operators

// **Definition:**

// Arithmetic operators are used to perform mathematical operations in C++.

// ### Types of Arithmetic Operators

// | Operator | Name | Example | Result |
// |:---:|---|:---:|:---:|
// | `+` | Addition | 5 + 2 | 7 |
// | `-` | Subtraction | 5 - 2 | 3 |
// | `*` | Multiplication | 5 * 2 | 10 |
// | `/` | Division | 5 / 2 | 2 |
// | `%` | Modulus | 5 % 2 | 1 |

